Name: ciwarn
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-09-18
Author: Andreas Bertsatos
Maintainer: Andreas Bertsatos <abertsatos@biol.uoa.gr>
Title: Warning Fixture for octave-ci
Description: A minimal package whose compiled function warns on purpose, used
 to check that the warnings job builds with the flags it was given, captures
 what the compiler wrote and filters it with warning-exclude.
Categories: Testing
Depends: octave (>= 11.1.0)
